        "t": 643.9358068359375,
        "r": 291.3737999999999,
        "b": 621.4340492035387
      },
      "content": "The following must be verified before using bio -diesel blends up to B20:",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_644",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_644",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0612",
      "reading_order": 646,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000001,
        "t": 617.4115068359374,
        "r": 267.45650000000006,
        "b": 605.0365068359374
      },
      "content": " The generator set is at Spec H or higher.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_644",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_644",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0613",
      "reading_order": 647,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000001,
        "t": 602.2744068359374,
        "r": 291.4002000000001,
        "b": 578.5736492035387
      },
      "content": " The vehicle propulsion engine is capable of using B20 when sharing the same fuel tank.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_644",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_644",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0614",
      "reading_order": 648,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 574.5511068359374,
        "r": 291.5696000000004,
        "b": 550.8503492035387
      },
      "content": " The OEM has installed B20 compatible fuel line from fuel tank to generator set.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_644",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_644",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0615",
      "reading_order": 649,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Above B5 and up to B20 Bio -Diesel Blends",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 546.8278068359374,
        "r": 291.5784,
        "b": 523.0709492035387
      },
      "content": " The OEM has installed a water separator in the fuel line just before the generator set.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_644",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
