    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0616",
      "reading_order": 650,
      "section": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.565400000000025,
        "t": 515.3546068359375,
        "r": 177.84280000000012,
        "b": 505.43904920353873
      },
      "content": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_650",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_650",
          "title": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0617",
      "reading_order": 651,
      "section": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 501.47370683593743,
        "r": 291.3771000000003,
        "b": 465.1306492035387
      },
      "content": " For biodiesel blends above B5 and up to B20, Cummins requires that the fuel meet the specifications outlined in ASTM D7467.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_650",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_650",
          "title": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0618",
      "reading_order": 652,
      "section": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 461.10810683593746,
        "r": 291.51130000000023,
        "b": 412.17884920353873
      },
      "content": " The  biodiesel  component  of  this  fuel  blend must meet ASTM D6751 or EN14214 and the petroleum diesel component must meet ASTM D975.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_650",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_650",
          "title": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0619",
      "reading_order": 653,
      "section": "Approved Bio -Diesel Fuel:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 408.15630683593747,
        "r": 291.3793000000001,
        "b": 384.3994492035388
      },
      "content": " Blended  bio -diesels  fuels  should  be  bought pre -blended and not made by customers.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_650",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_650",
