        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "id": "txt_0620",
      "reading_order": 654,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 47.56540000000003,
        "t": 364.04080683593753,
        "r": 156.4126,
        "b": 354.1252492035388
      },
      "content": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "level": 2,
      "section_id": "sec_auto_654",
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_654",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Properties:"
        }
      ],
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "section_heading",
      "semantic_role": "section_heading",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0621",
      "reading_order": 655,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000002,
        "t": 350.1599068359375,
        "r": 291.3760000000004,
        "b": 288.58834920353877
      },
      "content": " Bio -diesel  has  poor  oxidation  stability  which can accelerate fuel  oxidation.  Fuel  oxidation will reduce generator performance. This effect is accelerated at increased ambient temperatures.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_654",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_654",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Properties:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0622",
      "reading_order": 656,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91980000000004,
        "t": 284.5658068359375,
        "r": 291.50110000000024,
        "b": 210.41044920353875
      },
      "content": " Bio -diesel properties change at low ambient temperatures  (below  23  F/ -5  C).  Necessary precautions must be taken when operating the generator with bio -diesel blends in low ambient temperatures, such as a fuel heater, hose insulation, or additional anti -gel fuel additives.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_654",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_654",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Properties:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0623",
      "reading_order": 657,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 56.91950000000003,
        "t": 206.38790683593743,
        "r": 291.60670000000005,
        "b": 119.6439492035388
      },
      "content": " Bio -diesel fuel blends are an excellent medium for microbial growth. Microbes cause fuel system  corrosion  and  premature  filter  plugging. The effectiveness of all commercially available conventional  anti -microbial  additives,  when used in bio -diesel, is not known. Consult your fuel and additive supplier for assistance.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_654",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_654",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Properties:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_0624",
      "reading_order": 658,
      "section": "Bio -Diesel Properties:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 320.9386,
        "t": 736.9122068359375,
        "r": 564.8999000000001,
        "b": 613.1587492035388
      },
      "content": "WARNING It is highly recommended that specific market applications are avoided or excercised with extra care due to some of the properties of  bio -diesel fuel blends such as cold weather operation, long term storage, material incompatibilities and other effects on engine operating characteristics.  Such applications that should use standard fuels include applications that will experience seasonal usage, storage  for  periods  exceeding  90  days,  and  extreme temperatures or humidity.",
      "severity": "warning",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_654",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_8",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_8",
          "title": "8. Routine Maintenance"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_654",
          "title": "Bio -Diesel Properties:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 53,
      "chunk_hint": "admonition",
      "semantic_role": "warning",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
